<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila Broadcasting capital hike approved.</title>
<headline>Manila Broadcasting capital hike approved.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manila Broadcasting Corp said on Friday its shareholders had approved a board resolution increasing its capital stock to one billion pesos from the present four million pesos.</p>
<p>They had also ratified a 3,391.36 percent stock dividend worth 129 million pesos, corporate secretary Rudolph Julareal told the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
